{"3852770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Boomer Grandma", "steam_appid": 3852770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot, dodge, and defeat demons!</strong> This FPS condenses the basic elements of the genre into a small package. As &quot;<strong>Boomer Grandma</strong>,&quot; the legendary demon hunter, you have once again descended into Hell. Your mission is to rescue your grandchild, who has been kidnapped by the Demon King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852770/extras/1e921b6d3f4b54d99f04c4076dc39332.poster.avif?t=1761058850\" width=614 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852770/extras/1e921b6d3f4b54d99f04c4076dc39332.webm?t=1761058850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852770/extras/1e921b6d3f4b54d99f04c4076dc39332.mp4?t=1761058850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge fierce attacks and fire your heavy guns! Enjoy the primal pleasure of shooting and taking down your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no time to play at a leisurely pace. You have a limited time to wipe out the enemies, find the keys, and reach the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets hidden in each level and power up your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep trying each level and achieve a perfect score!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Contents</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 levels and a detailed tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique heavy guns (shotgun, minigun, plasma gun, rocket launcher) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 secrets</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't jump because you are a grandma.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is NO aim assist in this game, so playing with a gamepad can be more challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple game where you defeat all the demons that appear. It is NOT suitable for those who want to enjoy story or exploration.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For YouTubers and Streamers </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can stream videos of this game as long as you follow these two rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it clear to your audience that you are playing this game. For example, include the name of this game in the title of your video.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include a link to this Steam page in the description of your video.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot, dodge, and defeat demons!</strong> This FPS condenses the basic elements of the genre into a small package. As &quot;<strong>Boomer Grandma</strong>,&quot; the legendary demon hunter, you have once again descended into Hell. Your mission is to rescue your grandchild, who has been kidnapped by the Demon King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852770/extras/1e921b6d3f4b54d99f04c4076dc39332.poster.avif?t=1761058850\" width=614 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852770/extras/1e921b6d3f4b54d99f04c4076dc39332.webm?t=1761058850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852770/extras/1e921b6d3f4b54d99f04c4076dc39332.mp4?t=1761058850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge fierce attacks and fire your heavy guns! Enjoy the primal pleasure of shooting and taking down your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no time to play at a leisurely pace. You have a limited time to wipe out the enemies, find the keys, and reach the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets hidden in each level and power up your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep trying each level and achieve a perfect score!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Contents</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 levels and a detailed tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique heavy guns (shotgun, minigun, plasma gun, rocket launcher) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 secrets</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't jump because you are a grandma.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is NO aim assist in this game, so playing with a gamepad can be more challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple game where you defeat all the demons that appear. It is NOT suitable for those who want to enjoy story or exploration.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For YouTubers and Streamers </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can stream videos of this game as long as you follow these two rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it clear to your audience that you are playing this game. For example, include the name of this game in the title of your video.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include a link to this Steam page in the description of your video.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "This is a boomer shooter where you shoot, dodge,